# Signatory logos are fetched from the form's Drive folder at build time
# (see fetch_signatory_logos in build.py), so they're build output, not source.
# Drive stays the single source of truth and nobody has to commit an image
# when a new signatory signs up. To pin a hand-made override instead, drop the
# file in and force it past this rule: git add -f images/signatories/<slug>.png
images/signatories/
